      en: ["The highest peak is Cerro Tres Picos, at 1,239 meters.", "The 'La Ventana' formation is about 9 meters wide and 11 meters high.", "The mountains were formed about 500 million years ago.", "It is one of the few places in the province of Buenos Aires where it snows in winter.", "Hosts rare species such as the mountain iguana and the dwarf fern.", "The site contains rock paintings in the 'Cueva del Toro' area.", "The region is an important center for adventure and relaxation tourism."]
