      en: ["The summit is at an altitude of 1,049 meters above sea level.", "Its panoramic view is recognized worldwide for its beauty.", "The chairlift takes passengers up in about 7 minutes.", "Located at kilometer 17.5 of the famous 'Circuito Chico'.", "Features a panoramic confectionery at the top with spectacular views.", "Includes views of Laguna El Trébol and the arms of Lake Nahuel Huapi.", "It is one of the most visited tourist attractions in the Bariloche region."]
